      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Located on avenue de Verdun in Fréjus, Clinique Vétérinaire des Arènes offers a full technical setup — surgery, imaging, lab — alongside general medicine, with the added feature of complementary approaches such as homeopathy, osteopathy or acupuncture.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The clinic is open Monday to Friday from 9am to 7pm, and Saturday morning from 8am to 12pm. As with any clinic, calling ahead lets you check availability, especially outside of an emergency.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if your dog tends to get stressed at the vet, it may be worth asking the team about the complementary approaches offered here (osteopathy in particular).</div>

